=== STEP 1 — DELTA ===
- [NEW] api.sparelabs.com/v1/auth/email/reset/request: anonymous POST → 200 "OK" for arbitrary email even with **non-UUID** organizationId (no schema validation, no org lookup, no 404), repeated 4x no 429/rate-limit — unauthenticated password-reset initiation.
- [NEW] api.sparelabs.com/v1/auth/email/reset/verify: anonymous POST, schema {email,token,password,organizationId} disclosed, 401 InvalidTokenError on bad token, **no token-format oracle** (numeric/UUID/alpha → byte-identical 401).
- [NEW] api.sparelabs.com/v1/auth/rider/test/login: anonymous POST login, schema {username,password,organizationId}, distinct 401 UnauthorizedError "Failed to login using the provided credentials" on bad creds.
- [NEW] api.sparelabs.com/v1/auth/rider/pin/login: anonymous POST login, schema {phone,pin,organizationId,externalNumericId:number,phonePin:minLength6}, org lookup precedes cred check (404 zero-UUID), no rate-limit/retry-after headers across 3 sequential attempts.
- [NEW] api.sparelabs.com/v1/auth/rider/phone/request|verify: anonymous OTP flow, schema {phoneNumber,organizationId} (+code on verify), org lookup precedes code check (404 zero-UUID).
- [CHANGED] KNOWLEDGE CORRECTION: "auth ns edge-gated, no anonymous reset" (2026-08-08 10:13 UTC) **refuted** — only GET routes (auth/metadata, auth/token, auth/token/superAdmin) are 401 edge-gated; the entire POST login/OTP/reset surface runs anonymous with full OpenAPI schema disclosure.
- [STABLE] /v1/global/regions 200+725B; /v1/global/organizations 200+11B; /v1/public/terms 200 (orgId+mobileAppId); superAdmin 401-gated; CORS reflect uniform; /v1/global/{config,features} 401; /v1/global/regions/{id}/zones + /CA 400 auth-free.

