# spare-hunt

24/7 multi-model bug-hunting automation for **Spare**.

Scope: see `scope.yml` (in-scope assets, exclusions, rules).

How it works:

- 5 opencode models (Big Pickle, Nemotron 3 Ultra, Longcat, Ling 3.0, Laguna) hunt in parallel every **10 minutes**, rotating targets
- Deep public-repo scan of the `spare/` GitHub org(s) referenced in `scope.yml` every **30 minutes**
- Triager job validates every lead with a second model + live passive probe, keeping a running count in `reports/valid-bugs.md`
- All testing is **passive and read-only** (GET/HEAD, ≤1 rps, no account creation, no data modification) per program rules
- Secrets are committed only as hashes; findings must be reported through the program channel referenced in `scope.yml`

| Artifact | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `research/` | Per-model research journals |
| `leads/` | Candidate findings (UNVALIDATED) |
| `triage/` | Validation verdicts |
| `reports/valid-bugs.md` | Validated findings + running count |
| `scope.yml` | Program scope and rules (edit to adjust) |
---
name: Senior Hunter - Analyst Pipeline (spare)

on:
  schedule:
    - cron: "*/10 * * * *"
  workflow_dispatch:

permissions:
  contents: write
  actions: write

jobs:
  analyst:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    timeout-minutes: 25
    concurrency:
      group: hunt-${{ matrix.model.name }}
      cancel-in-progress: true
    strategy:
      fail-fast: false
      matrix:
        model:
          - { id: opencode/big-pickle, name: bigpickle }
          - { id: opencode/nemotron-3-ultra-free, name: nemotron3 }
          - { id: opencode/longcat-2.0-free, name: longcat }
          - { id: opencode/ling-3.0-flash-free, name: ling3 }
          - { id: opencode/laguna-s-2.1-free, name: laguna }

    env:
      MODEL_ID: ${{ matrix.model.id }}
      MODEL_NAME: ${{ matrix.model.name }}

    steps:
      - name: Checkout
        uses: actions/checkout@v5

      - name: Install OpenCode
        run: |
          export PATH="$HOME/.opencode/bin:$HOME/.local/bin:$HOME/.npm-global/bin:$PATH"
          if command -v opencode >/dev/null 2>&1; then
            opencode --version
            exit 0
          fi
          npm install -g opencode-ai 2>/dev/null || npm install -g --prefix "$HOME/.npm-global" opencode-ai 2>/dev/null || true
          if ! command -v opencode >/dev/null 2>&1; then
            for i in 1 2 3; do
              curl -fsSL https://opencode.ai/install | bash && break
              echo "opencode.ai installer attempt $i failed, retrying in 15s..."
              sleep 15
            done
          fi
          export PATH="$HOME/.opencode/bin:$HOME/.local/bin:$HOME/.npm-global/bin:$PATH"
          opencode --version


      - name: Prepare context (RAG + state + inventory + last cycle)
        run: |
          mkdir -p knowledge inventory leads reports
          [ -f knowledge/index.md ] || echo "# Knowledge Base (seed)" > knowledge/index.md
          [ -f state_${MODEL_NAME}.json ] || echo '{"phase":"RECON","target":"api"}' > state_${MODEL_NAME}.json
