- [CHANGED] UUID `0606efa8-59e1-4d08-9e1e-3b5e6a1f6e00` is **NOT a real org** (`/v1/public/organization` oracle→404 this session). `/v1/public/terms` therefore returns 200+terms for ANY well-formed UUID → no org-existence validation; disclosure is default/non-org-scoped data (severity cap lowered).
- [NEW] `/v1/public/{settings,config,regions,apps,version,health}`→404 0B; `/v1/public/organizations`→400 "not found" (re-confirmed). No new public-namespace routes.
